            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our International Performance Marketing packages include full campaign management across Google Search, Display, Shopping, YouTube Ads, Meta (Facebook & Instagram) Lead/Conversion Ads, LinkedIn B2B Ads, GTM server-side tracking, Meta Conversions API (CAPI), A/B creative testing, landing page CRO, and weekly ROAS reporting."
