            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Package pricing covers complete ad strategy, audience research, creative design, copywriting, landing page CRO, server-side CAPI tracking setup, and bid management. Ad spend is paid directly to ad networks (Google/Meta/LinkedIn)."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How quickly do performance marketing campaigns generate qualified leads?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Performance marketing campaigns start delivering inbound sales leads and revenue on Day 1 of launch. Campaign ROAS is continuously optimized over 30 to 60 days."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What conversion tracking tools do you configure?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We setup Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics 4 (GA4) custom event tracking, Meta Conversions API (CAPI), Google Ads offline conversion imports, and call tracking."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Who manages my international performance marketing account?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Your campaigns are managed by certified Google & Meta PPC engineers and copywriters supervised directly by Founder Gaurav Dubey."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why choose King of Digital Marketing for International Performance Marketing?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We bring 13+ years of performance marketing experience delivering over 900+ high-ROAS campaigns across 15+ countries, backed by transparent USD pricing and weekly KPI reports."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
